ant supernatural forces, it's a whacky alternate history brought about by wishful thinkers. And as such it doesn't ring true, it doesn't resonate with everyone, because it no longer represents something real to them.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Let me throw this out there, People called Pathfinder &quot;Real D&amp;D&quot; when 4e was out because it provided an alternative. Let me me throw you another thing on the storyteller vault is a complete gam developed around the Pre War of Rage Werewolf setting. The writer bought art, made whole new mechanics built completely new fera and so on. <br /> <br /> What am I getting at here? You are litterally wasting your time with these screeds. Write yourown damned Storyteller Vault &quot;Vampire 2020&quot; you can use whatever edition you want as a basis. YOu can use whatever metaplot you want. IF there is really this great mass of people who feel this way... You will make money. They will see how wrong they were for daring to write v5. You then win. But this? its a waste of time that goes no where. Make yourown STV product.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-13T14:38:22-07:00","id":1381099,"title":"","content":"i know you dislike V5 but at a certain point ppl will start to worry about you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25992-archderd","name":"archderd","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"